SUMMARY:Serbia: Contributions for founders and members of companies
DESCRIPTION:Contributions for founders and members of a company are calcula
 ted and paid by the 15th of the month for the previous month (Law on Manda
 tory Social Insurance Contributions\, Art. 53 and Art. 60 para 3).\nApplie
 s to: Companies\, for founders or members only\; not ordinary employees (p
 aid with wages)\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https:
 //purs.gov.rs/upload/media/2025/12/15/760519/%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B
 D_%D0%BE_%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B
 0_%D0%B7%D0%B0_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%BE_%D1%81%D0%
