 3%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%9A%D0%B5_-_%D1%83_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0
 %B8_%D0%BE%D0%B4_01012026.pdf\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/
 deadlines.html#serbia\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. D
 ates follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holiday
 s are not applied. Sources last checked 12 October 2026.
